        "created_at": "2017-07-29T19:10:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thinking about the boards, I wonder if there is any plan in the future to add a Board E and F.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Canonical playmat has six different lands, and symbols which are supposed to appear with a later expansion. So, is the plan to eventually release two additional boards so you can actually build the canonical map seen on the play mat?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
